#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:15
msgid "J1 Issue the newborn's birth-dose DVCs in Country A"
msgstr "J1 在 A 国签发新生儿出生剂次 DVC"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:21
msgid "J1, Cross-border birth and initial vaccination. In Country A (XXR, the birth country) the provincial hospital gives a newborn who is not its own country's national the Hep B and BCG birth doses and issues one signed DVC per dose (DVCMinPreQual at subclaim -6) as a paper QR, with no national identity number needed (the WHO guide's QR Code Generation section 12 example is such a pair). The hospital system is the Issuer (SMART Trust) and the HCERT side of the VHL Sharer; the private key stays with the key holder (two-phase signing, <a0>STT-ISS-004</a0>, <a1>STT-COS-006</a1>). XXR's DSC, under its CSCA, being on the GDHCN trust list is a PRECONDITION of issuing, declared below, not a step. The caregiver is the Holder (SMART Trust, smart-trust-phw) and VHL Holder (IHE ITI VHL)."
msgstr "J1，跨境出生与首次疫苗接种。在 A 国（XXR，出生国），省级医院为一名非本国国民的新生儿接种乙肝（Hep B）和卡介苗（BCG）出生剂次，并为每一剂次签发一份已签名的 DVC（子声明 -6 处的 DVCMinPreQual），以纸质 QR 码形式提供，无需国民身份证号（WHO 指南“QR Code Generation”第 12 节的示例就是这样一对）。医院系统是签发方（Issuer，SMART Trust），也是 VHL 共享方（VHL Sharer）的 HCERT 一侧；私钥保留在密钥持有者处（两阶段签名，<a0>STT-ISS-004</a0>、<a1>STT-COS-006</a1>）。XXR 的 DSC（隶属其 CSCA）已列入 GDHCN 信任列表，这是签发的前提条件（PRECONDITION），在下文声明，而非一个步骤。照护者是持有人（Holder，SMART Trust、smart-trust-phw）和 VHL 持有人（VHL Holder，IHE ITI VHL）。"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:26
msgid "J2 Discover and refer an unregistered infant in Country B"
msgstr "J2 在 B 国发现并转诊未登记婴儿"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:32
msgid "J2, Return home, CHW discovery and referral. Back in Country B (home, XXH), where the family resides, the community health worker finds an infant born abroad who is missing from the household roster on a home visit. Offline, the CHW app adds the infant to the household (a FHIR Group, through a structured data capture form), reads the foreign DVCs without verifying them (read-unverified, <a0>STT-VER-011</a0>: the triage read stops before the trust lookup and marks every field unverified), saves the doses as reported by the family, not verified (Immunization.primarySource false), and refers the infant to the clinic for verification. Everything is queued on the phone and syncs when it next has a signal. The CHW app is a Receiver (SMART Trust, smart-trust-phw) that deliberately stops before trust; the caregiver provides the VDHC as Holder (smart-trust-phw requirement provide-a-vhl-to-a-receiver)."
msgstr "J2，回国、CHW 发现与转诊。回到家庭居住的 B 国（本国，XXH）后，社区卫生工作者在一次家访中发现一名在境外出生、未列入家庭成员名册的婴儿。在离线状态下，CHW 应用将该婴儿添加到家庭中（一个 FHIR Group，通过结构化数据采集表单），读取境外 DVC 但不验证（read-unverified，<a0>STT-VER-011</a0>：分诊读取在信任查询之前停止，并将每个字段标记为未验证），将剂次保存为家庭报告、未经验证（Immunization.primarySource 为 false），并将婴儿转诊至诊所进行验证。所有内容都在手机上排队，待下次有信号时同步。CHW 应用是一个接收方（Receiver，SMART Trust、smart-trust-phw），它有意在信任环节之前停止；照护者作为持有人提供 VDHC（smart-trust-phw 需求 provide-a-vhl-to-a-receiver）。"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:37
msgid "J3 Verify, import and schedule at the home clinic"
msgstr "J3 在所属诊所验证、导入并制定接种计划"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:43
msgid "J3, Clinic verification and schedule generation, in Country B. The clinic EHR (Receiver in SMART Trust and smart-trust-phw, VHL Receiver side in IHE ITI VHL) holds a copy of the GDHCN trust list, which the trust anchor (Trust Network Anchor; IHE Trust Anchor) distributes and Country B, a Trust Network Participant, retrieves (smart-trust-phw retrieve-pki-material). Loading the DID documents is a PRECONDITION of this visit, not a step in it: the clinic may be offline throughout, so the list it verifies against is the one it last refreshed, about weekly, when the CHW visits the base clinic or district health office. It verifies each foreign DVC in the <a0>STT-VER-001</a0> order against XXR's DSC DID document, imports the verified doses with provenance, adds the national schedule code beside each foreign vaccine code (ConceptMap; the nurse decides any product with no mapping) and evaluates the national schedule, which finds the 6-week doses due and books them."
msgstr "J3，在 B 国进行诊所验证并生成接种计划。诊所 EHR（在 SMART Trust 和 smart-trust-phw 中为接收方，在 IHE ITI VHL 中为 VHL 接收方一侧）保存一份 GDHCN 信任列表副本，该列表由信任锚（Trust Network Anchor；IHE Trust Anchor）分发，并由信任网络参与方 B 国获取（smart-trust-phw retrieve-pki-material）。加载 DID 文档是本次就诊的前提条件（PRECONDITION），而非其中的一个步骤：诊所可能全程离线，因此其验证所依据的列表是上次刷新的版本，大约每周一次，在 CHW 前往基地诊所或县卫生办公室时刷新。它按照 <a0>STT-VER-001</a0> 的顺序，依据 XXR 的 DSC DID 文档验证每份境外 DVC，连同来源信息导入经验证的剂次，在每个境外疫苗代码旁添加国家接种计划代码（ConceptMap；没有映射的产品由护士判定），并评估国家接种计划，从而发现 6 周龄剂次已到期并进行预约。"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:48
msgid "J4.0 Issue the family's records to one phone as VHLs"
msgstr "J4.0 将家庭记录以 VHL 形式签发到同一部手机"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:54
msgid "J4.0, Outbound family travel, \"One Family, One Phone\". Before travelling, the caregiver who holds the family's one shared phone asks Country B's national portal for each family member's records, choosing for each a passcode the family can say aloud and an expiry (for example 14 days); the portal records that choice as the holder's consent to share (FHIR Consent, IHE Privacy Consent on FHIR). The portal, a VHL Sharer (IHE ITI VHL) and Issuer (SMART Trust, smart-trust-phw), issues one passcode-protected Verifiable Health Link per member: the documents (IPS, DVCs) encrypted as JWE (<a0>STT-VHL-007</a0>) behind an ITI-YY5 manifest, the link in the SMART Health Links payload format at HCERT key 5 (<a1>STT-VHL-001</a1>, <a2>STT-VHL-002</a2>), signed with Country B's DSC. The shared phone holds the QRs for the caregiver, the VHL Holder. The records themselves stay hosted in Country B: the QR carries only a pointer and a key."
msgstr "J4.0，家庭出境旅行，“一个家庭，一部手机”。出行前，持有家庭共用手机的照护者向 B 国国家门户申请每位家庭成员的记录，并为每份记录选择一个家人可以口头说出的通行码和一个有效期（例如 14 天）；门户将这一选择记录为持有人的共享同意（FHIR Consent，IHE Privacy Consent on FHIR）。该门户作为 VHL 共享方（VHL Sharer，IHE ITI VHL）和签发方（Issuer，SMART Trust、smart-trust-phw），为每位成员签发一个受通行码保护的可验证健康链接（VHL）：文档（IPS、DVC）以 JWE 加密（<a0>STT-VHL-007</a0>），置于 ITI-YY5 清单之后；链接采用 SMART Health Links 载荷格式，位于 HCERT 键 5（<a1>STT-VHL-001</a1>、<a2>STT-VHL-002</a2>），并以 B 国的 DSC 签名。共用手机为照护者（即 VHL 持有人）保存这些 QR 码。记录本身仍托管在 B 国：QR 码只携带一个指针和一个密钥。"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:59
msgid "J4.1 Read a family member's records at the point of care abroad"
msgstr "J4.1 在境外医疗服务点读取家庭成员的记录"

#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:65
msgid "J4.1. Abroad, a child of the family needs care. The caregiver, the VHL Holder (IHE ITI VHL; Holder in SMART Trust and smart-trust-phw, requirement provide-a-vhl-to-a-receiver), opens her QR on the family phone and tells the passcode. The hospital system, a VHL Receiver (Receiver in SMART Trust and smart-trust-phw), verifies the HCERT against the GDHCN trust list, requests the manifest by ITI-YY5 with an HTTP Message Signature (<a0>STT-VHL-005</a0>, <a1>STT-VHL-006</a1>, <a2>STT-VHL-008</a2>) and decrypts the documents (<a3>STT-VHL-007</a3>). Country B's portal checks the passcode, returns the manifest and logs every request, granted or refused, as an AuditEvent at home (IHE BALP). If the HCERT does not verify, there is no digital verification: the VHL is not followed and the records are treated like paper. As in J3, loading the DID documents is a PRECONDITION of this visit, not a step in it: the hospital verifies against its cached copy of the trust list and needs no connection to do so. It refreshes that cache nightly or hourly, where an offline site such as the J3 clinic refreshes about weekly."
msgstr "J4.1。在境外，家中一名孩子需要就医。照护者，即 VHL 持有人（IHE ITI VHL；在 SMART Trust 和 smart-trust-phw 中为持有人，需求 provide-a-vhl-to-a-receiver），在家庭手机上打开她的 QR 码并说出通行码。医院系统作为 VHL 接收方（在 SMART Trust 和 smart-trust-phw 中为接收方），依据 GDHCN 信任列表验证 HCERT，通过 ITI-YY5 并附带 HTTP 消息签名（HTTP Message Signature）请求清单（<a0>STT-VHL-005</a0>、<a1>STT-VHL-006</a1>、<a2>STT-VHL-008</a2>），并解密文档（<a3>STT-VHL-007</a3>）。B 国门户核验通行码、返回清单，并将每一次请求（无论允许或拒绝）作为 AuditEvent 记录在本国（IHE BALP）。如果 HCERT 未通过验证，则不进行数字验证：不跟随该 VHL，记录按纸质记录对待。与 J3 一样，加载 DID 文档是本次就诊的前提条件（PRECONDITION），而非其中的一个步骤：医院依据其缓存的信任列表副本进行验证，无需联网。它每晚或每小时刷新该缓存，而 J3 诊所这类离线站点大约每周刷新一次。"

